                    memorandum and wrote: “Cy.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f2" n="2" xml:id="d59-f2-content">
                <p>July 11.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f3" n="3" xml:id="d59-f3-content">
                <p>No record of meeting minutes has been found. See <ref target="#d58-f7">footnotes
                        7</ref> and <ref target="#d58-f10">10, Document 58</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f4" n="4" xml:id="d59-f4-content">
                <p> Carter wrote in the left margin: “This will make Congress approval almost
                    impossible.”</p>
            </note>
